<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's First Bank year profits climb.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's First Bank year profits climb.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Nigeria's First Bank to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		1995</p>
<p>Gross Income		  10,995    vs    8,980</p>
<p>Profit before taxation     1,385    vs    1,238</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	1,202    vs    1,009</p>
<p>Dividend per share	   56 kobo  vs    70 kobo</p>
<p>NOTE: A bonus was declared of one new share for four.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
